{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/extras/80012f929f90c9ca43d622197cd581ce.avif?t=1769457775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/extras_big/80012f929f90c9ca43d622197cd581ce.avif?t=1769457775 width=800 height=1016 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Subjugation you're sent deep under ground to a decrepit containment chamber. In the center lies a horror unbeknownst to the world, but always a threat to it. You must keep the systems supporting it running to keep it stable. Giving it a consistent feed of oxygen, water, and punishing it from it's anger is vital to keeping it content and complacent with containment, and to avoid it reaching from the depths to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an experimental short form horror game, with the main game taking one hour real time to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Suspenseful Gameplay and objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Decrepit PSX artstyle and atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Optional Puzzles to solve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Lore Rich notes and voice notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2748970?t=1769457775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2748970?t=1769457775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/351066bf747f930feb408ceab63909a2a97b1e3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769457775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/351066bf747f930feb408ceab63909a2a97b1e3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769457775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"SUBJUGATION contains potentially disturbing imagery such as blood and gore."},"demos":[{"appid":3767380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/extras/80012f929f90c9ca43d622197cd581ce.avif?t=1769457775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/extras_big/80012f929f90c9ca43d622197cd581ce.avif?t=1769457775 width=800 height=1016 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Subjugation you're sent deep under ground to a decrepit containment chamber. In the center lies a horror unbeknownst to the world, but always a threat to it. You must keep the systems supporting it running to keep it stable. Giving it a consistent feed of oxygen, water, and punishing it from it's anger is vital to keeping it content and complacent with containment, and to avoid it reaching from the depths to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an experimental short form horror game, with the main game taking one hour real time to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Suspenseful Gameplay and objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Decrepit PSX artstyle and atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Optional Puzzles to solve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Lore Rich notes and voice notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Basement Dweller Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/b067580f007a543bea87d14b3ce5c576e7dea1c7/header.jpg?t=1769457775","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"SUBJUGATION and all assets included are exclusive property of Basement Dweller Games, unauthorized redistribution is strictly prohibited","li